{"id":"990e93a33f4633db","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-null-set.md","title":"Null Set","display":"df-null-set — Null Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-null-set","aliases":["58-df-null-set"],"display":"df-null-set — Null Set","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-null-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-null-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-null-set — Null Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq X\">\\(N\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\\)</span> (null-set predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}null-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land N\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(N)=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}null-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land N\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(N)=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the measurable-null-set notion. The former covering formula omitted measurability of the covering sets and instead approximated an unspecified outer-measure condition.</li>\n<li>They are negligible in integration theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$ (measure space, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"N\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NullSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}null-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land N\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(N)=0","display":true}],"bytes":875,"backlinks":[{"id":"952055ea38b3b9ae","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NullSet}_S$ (零测集谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]])"},{"id":"81608826d1fc98bd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0a75c1a17d157e95","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1